    <!--
      ROW LABELS. Only the load-bearing rows carry one, and every label below
      is SOURCED rather than inferred:

        * the computation spine and its comments in
          ``models/cssk_income_tax.py`` (``_compute_tax_spine``), which cite
          the DPPOv24/v25 eForm routines and the DPPOv25 poučenie by row;
        * ``cssk.income.tax.version.provision_line_code``'s help;
        * the module CHANGELOG for r100.

      Rows with NO label are not an omission anybody forgot — they are rows
      this repository has no source for, and inventing a statutory row name
      that reads as authoritative is worse than a blank. Label one when the
      poučenie for its vzor says what it is, not before.

      THE 800/900 BLOCK IS DIFFERENT, and it caught us out once already. There
      the form REUSED row numbers between the daňová licencia era (to 2017)
      and the minimálna daň era (from 2024) — r820 is the kladný rozdiel on
      the licencia vzory, r900 moves from "Daňová licencia na úhradu" to
      "Suma na účely určenia výšky preddavkov". So r800/r810/r820/r830/r900
      are labelled ONLY where a source covers that vzor:

        * 2017-2019 from Finančná správa SR, "Usmernenie k započítaniu
          daňovej licencie v súlade s § 46b ods. 5 a § 52zk", 20. 12. 2018,
          which prints the vzor's own captions;
        * 2024-2025 from the spine's DPPOv25 poučenie citations.

      2013-2015 and 2020-2022 are bare in that block on purpose. The first
      version of this file extrapolated the v24/v25 spine backwards and got
      r820 and r900 wrong; the usmernenie disagreed. Do not infer a row in
      this block from another vzor.
    -->
  <record id="dppo_version_2025" model="cssk.income.tax.version">
    <field name="name">DPPO 2025</field>
    <field name="country_id" ref="base.sk"/>
    <field name="valid_from">2025-01-01</field>
    <field name="valid_to">2025-12-31</field>
    <field name="xml_template_ref_id" ref="l10n_sk_dppo.dppo2025_xml"/>
    <field name="xml_root_element">dokument</field>
    <!-- dppo2025_v2.xsd, not dppo2025.xsd. FS SR published a REVISION under
         a new name beside the unchanged original: v2 adds a repeatable
         `dalsiaTransakcia` (further controlled transactions) and is otherwise
         the same file. Being a superset it accepts every document the first
         one did, so filing against it is strictly safer — and a digest check
         on the pinned name could never have seen it. -->
    <field name="xml_schema_filename">dppo2025_v2.xsd</field>
    <field name="xml_schema_data" type="base64" file="l10n_sk_dppo/data/dppo2025_v2.xsd"/>
    <field name="provision_line_code">r1050</field>
    <!-- § 15 ods. 1 zák. 595/2003 Z. z. v znení od 1.1.2025, keyed on r560
         (úhrn zdaniteľných príjmov): 10 % ≤ 100 000 €, 21 % ≤ 5 000 000 €,
         24 % above. Upper bounds are INCLUSIVE; null (None) = top band. -->
    <field name="rate_bands" eval="[[100000.0, 10.0], [5000000.0, 21.0], [None, 24.0]]"/>
    <!-- § 46b ods. 2 minimálna daň (Metodický pokyn 9/DZPaU/2025/MP):
         340 € ≤ 50 000 €, 960 € ≤ 250 000 €, 1 920 € ≤ 500 000 €, 3 840 €
         above. No higher band exists in current law; do not speculate a
         future > 5M band here. -->
    <field name="min_tax_bands" eval="[[50000.0, 340.0], [250000.0, 960.0], [500000.0, 1920.0], [None, 3840.0]]"/>
  </record>
